Phases: PHASE2, PHASE3; Conditions: ['Post-operative Cognitive Dysfunction']; Drug: ['phenylephrine', 'intravenous fluids', 'ephedrine', 'epinephrine', 'norepinephrine', 'dopamine']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria:

* any patient aged 75 years and more scheduled for elective non-cardiac surgery under general anesthesia.

Exclusion criteria:

