Phases: PHASE3; Conditions: ["Non-Hodgkin's Lymphoma"]; Drug: ['rituximab [mabthera/rituxan]', 'standard chemotherapy']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria:

* adult patients \>=18 years of age;
* advanced, low-grade non-Hodgkin's and mantle cell lymphoma.

Exclusion Criteria:

