Phases: PHASE3; Conditions: ['Multiple Myeloma']; Drug: ['thalidomide plus dexamethasone', 'dexamethasone']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria:

* symptomatic multiple myeloma in accordance with the International Myeloma Working Group criteria;
* age 18-70 years;
