Phases: PHASE2, PHASE3; Conditions: ['Exudative Macular Degeneration', 'Retinal Hemorrhage']; Drug: ['ranibizumab', 'c3f8 gas', 'tpa']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion criteria:

* Adults of either sex aged 50 years and older;
