Phases: PHASE3; Conditions: ['Advanced Cancer', 'Metastatic Cancer']; Drug: ['nadroparin calcium', 'saline solution ()']; Eligibility Criteria: INCLUSION CRITERIA:

* both sexes;aged\>18 years;
